WEBVTT

00:00:07.860 --> 00:00:09.680
Christmas!

00:00:09.940 --> 00:00:11.900
Christmas!

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.000
Today is a merry Christmas!

00:00:16.220 --> 00:00:18.240
A cake, Santa...

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:19.830
And presents!

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:22.920
We're parting with Rinna.

00:00:22.980 --> 00:00:25.960
Come to the Ultima and play!

00:00:25.920 --> 00:00:27.470
Farewell, Rinna Of course!

