This is Shima!

00:23:08.980 --> 00:23:11.940
You seem pretty merry... This is Arisa!

00:23:12.020 --> 00:23:14.540
The farewell party is over, so finally, at last...

00:23:14.620 --> 00:23:17.160
So finally, at last, it's winter vacation!

00:23:17.190 --> 00:23:18.050
All right!

00:23:18.380 --> 00:23:20.020
Shipon, what are you doing for winter vacation?

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.960
Um, first, once we arrive in Nazca on the Fujiyama...

00:23:23.030 --> 00:23:24.860
I have to go shopping, then go home...

00:23:24.930 --> 00:23:28.010
With that said, the next episode feels like it's going to be an intermission.

00:23:28.530 --> 00:23:30.720
On the next episode of Stellvia of the Universe, "Winter Vacation"

00:23:30.900 --> 00:23:31.800
